msgid "Caller ensures this region is quiescent and painting had no live frames. No Arch/OS dependency or internal mask occurs. Work is at most bytes reads. Unwritten reservations or writes equal to paint can hide usage; this is not overflow detection. MSP qualification needs independently established boot paint and a quiescent sampling point. The span excludes current SP, all active frames and exception-stack reservation. It never paints or claims to read the physical MSP register."
msgstr "Caller ensures this region is quiescent and painting had no live frames. No Arch/OS dependency or internal mask occurs. Work is at most bytes reads. Unwritten reservations or writes equal to paint can hide usage; this is not overflow detection. MSP qualification needs independently established boot paint and a quiescent sampling point. The span excludes current SP, all active frames and exception-stack reservation. It never paints or claims to read the physical MSP register."

